Customers can have orders delivered or collect them in-store, making the branch convenient for both small top-up purchases and larger building-material orders. It serves homeowners, DIY enthusiasts and renovators across Karenpark and the surrounding Pretoria suburbs who are working on building, gardening or home-improvement projects of varying sizes, from single rooms to full renovations.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'builders-express-wonderpark-karenpark' AND description = 'Builders Express Wonderpark is a hardware store at Wonderpark Shopping Centre in Karenpark, Pretoria, part of the Builders chain, offering DIY, paint, and building materials with delivery and in-store pickup.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
